            {
                "entry_id": "0f54758d-9198-3696-9ccd-136d7afe30a9",
                "word": "hi",
                "pos": "onomatopoeia",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d82fa206-e181-4c28-a5a5-1ced7e39902e",
                        "entry_id": "0f54758d-9198-3696-9ccd-136d7afe30a9",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "hihi"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "699d8d33-2808-3757-aae9-83499ead6638",
                        "entry_id": "0f54758d-9198-3696-9ccd-136d7afe30a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cri de peur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b651fd51-7b85-49d0-9f56-082c89c6158d",
                                "sense_id": "699d8d33-2808-3757-aae9-83499ead6638",
                                "text": "Dona Isabel : Vous ne m’aimez pas.\nLe secrétaire, avec un cri aigu : Hi ! ma parole, vous allez me faire faire des fautes ! J’allais écrire : vous ne m’aimez pas, sur l’enveloppe. Monsieur le Corregidor Ruiz Zeballos, à Vounemémépaz."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d6a36994-b3e3-3491-8364-a9c0b53b49f2",
                        "entry_id": "0f54758d-9198-3696-9ccd-136d7afe30a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sanglot, pleur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Le plus souvent répété"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca549af4-9427-491e-8076-d68837895f7f",
                                "sense_id": "d6a36994-b3e3-3491-8364-a9c0b53b49f2",
                                "text": "« Ne dirait-on pas… hi ! hi !… que nous sommes… hi ! hi… Les gens les plus malheureux… hi ! hi !… de l’univers ? »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed3551f9-932d-4228-ba24-fbb23f6c9338",
                                "sense_id": "d6a36994-b3e3-3491-8364-a9c0b53b49f2",
                                "text": "Elle nous dit entre ses sanglots qu’elle ne fait que penser à ce pauvre intendant Dubut, tué en Chine : « On lui a arraché le nez… Hi ! hi ! hi! et les oreilles… Hi ! hi ! hi ! »."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "723dc748-295e-4234-955d-780f79154752",
                                "sense_id": "d6a36994-b3e3-3491-8364-a9c0b53b49f2",
                                "text": "Ah ! bonne Vierge, dit la jeune femme qui fondit en larmes tout à coup, et maintenant je reste seule, tu m’abandonnes… Hi ! hi ! hi ! que je suis malheureuse !"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bcc0568a-ab14-388b-b7b5-05efa980f491",
                        "entry_id": "0f54758d-9198-3696-9ccd-136d7afe30a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gloussement de rire étouffé ou forcé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a96bfda2-b83f-4075-93dd-ef8bf07db574",
                                "sense_id": "bcc0568a-ab14-388b-b7b5-05efa980f491",
                                "text": "« Ça gêne pas ici, que je fume ? » qu’elle me demande… « Non, Madame, mais non, seulement il faut faire attention aux cendres ! à cause des papiers par terre ! Ça prendrait feu facilement ! Hi ! hi! » il faut bien rigoler un peu…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2abdb6eb-f6b3-41e4-8993-a4fc952be64c",
                                "sense_id": "bcc0568a-ab14-388b-b7b5-05efa980f491",
                                "text": "L’hygiène ça compte quand même. Mort aux poux ! Mort aux pions ! Morpoux morpions pas mauvaise celle-là. — Hi, hi, fit Jacques. — Trêve de rigolade."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc67e1c4-cf10-4613-bf64-9c16f48958e8",
                                "sense_id": "bcc0568a-ab14-388b-b7b5-05efa980f491",
                                "text": "Hi, hi, hi ! fit Andoche Finot."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "af598228-3870-4306-886c-312ea28ef357",
                        "source_entry_id": "0f54758d-9198-3696-9ccd-136d7afe30a9",
                        "target_lang_word": "hee",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hee",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8e1e503-e136-30c7-b14e-f0a320263c78",
                                        "entry_id": "e6b8771a-4b32-3b00-a24c-67e6c4113726",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expression of laughter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "onomatopoeic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e43bf4a-498f-4a1f-9d40-6e12e11e5da3",
                                                "sense_id": "e8e1e503-e136-30c7-b14e-f0a320263c78",
                                                "text": "\"Good evening, Kristen,\" said I; \"what are you telling that creates such fun?\" \"Hee, hee, hee!\" screamed the youngsters, with great glee depicted in their faces; \"Kristen has told us about the smith and the devil, and then about the lad who got him into the nut, and now he says he's going to tell us about Peter Sannum, whose horse the fairies stopped on the Asmyr hill.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b87db3cb-fbea-3f49-9e41-5d11bcd71f14",
                                        "entry_id": "e6b8771a-4b32-3b00-a24c-67e6c4113726",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Said accompanying a vigorous attack."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "406def8c-0748-4cca-a8ad-79fb188d80c0",
                                                "sense_id": "b87db3cb-fbea-3f49-9e41-5d11bcd71f14",
                                                "text": "Hyde: (Leaps from desk. LADY BUGG runs behind the sofa. HYDE follows.) Hee, hee, hee! LADY BUGG: Help! Murder! Police!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca10dd60-11bb-4376-8fe0-6ab4f914edcc",
                                                "sense_id": "b87db3cb-fbea-3f49-9e41-5d11bcd71f14",
                                                "text": "Mona: Hee! Ha! Ho! Ha! The brain buffet is closed, buddy! Take that! And this!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "889cfac5-f103-403a-8885-ac878a54b76e",
                                                "sense_id": "b87db3cb-fbea-3f49-9e41-5d11bcd71f14",
                                                "text": "Listen! Fire Thunder sprang from the back of the dying pony to the back of a passing buffalo! Hee-hee! He landed facing the tail! He grabbed that tail and twisted it and made his buffalo go wherever he wanted to go. Hee-hee!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hee",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "abd3d74d-6fbe-3dc1-aaa1-31f28060ee72",
                                        "entry_id": "1dc45b44-9b66-3217-b808-bec03353c916",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obsolete spelling of he (sometimes emphatic)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "personal",
                                            "pronoun"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd8bab63-600a-4f7b-8e73-5f27ebb8b5b4",
                                                "sense_id": "abd3d74d-6fbe-3dc1-aaa1-31f28060ee72",
                                                "text": "He ended, and the Son gave signal high\nTo the bright Minister that watchd, hee blew\nHis Trumpet"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
